Modified by Expensify: the weights are stored as FP16 instead of FP32 to halve the file size. They are cast back to
FP32 when the model loads, so inference still runs in FP32. The network and its outputs are otherwise unchanged.
Its NOTICE file lists the datasets the model was trained on (UVDoc, SmartDoc, Describable Textures Dataset, CORD); none
of their images or labels are part of the model or of this repository.
